## Original Content
President Trump is calling on world leaders to join his economic war against Iran. And, the Supreme Court is backing the president for now on his order to restrict mail-in voting.

## Summary
President Trump is urging world leaders to isolate Iran through economic measures. The Supreme Court has temporarily supported Trump's decision to restrict mail-in voting.

## Key Points
- Trump calls for economic isolation of Iran.
- Supreme Court backs Trump's order on mail-in voting restrictions.
- The actions involve international diplomacy and domestic legal issues.


